FourierTensor includes source derived from the OpenAI math repository.

Upstream repository: https://github.com/openai/math
Pinned source revision: fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb
Upstream license: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The vendored OpenAIUniformFourierBundle preserves the upstream definitions and
proofs with local Lean/mathlib compatibility edits. The source module hashes,
generation recipe, compatibility edits and generated bundle hash are recorded
under provenance/.

The prime-counting compatibility argument adapts Apache-2.0 mathlib work by
Bolton Bailey, Ralf Stephan, Alastair Irving, Terry Tao, and Ruben Van de Velde.
Its source revision and attribution remain in the copied compatibility proof.
